BT 1 0 0 1 0 27.3 Tm /F1 8.7 Tf 12 TL (The following compact C11 prototype demonstrates the three required modules: a linear-probing hash index, a stable) Tj T* -0.06131 Tw (min-heap priority queue and insertion/quick sorting. It is intended as a core-module implementation; compile with the command) Tj T* 0 Tw (shown and extend the menu/interface if a fully interactive menu is required by the instructor.) Tj T* ET
