BT 1 0 0 1 0 63.3 Tm /F1 8.7 Tf 12 TL (This assignment applied hashing, priority queues, heaps and sorting techniques to a digital learning and analytics platform.) Tj T* (Separate chaining and linear probing provide alternative collision-resolution strategies; tombstones preserve search) Tj T* (correctness after deletion. A stable min-heap schedules urgent jobs while maintaining arrival order for ties. Insertion, quick,) Tj T* (merge, radix and heap sorting each serve different data and memory requirements. Parallel CPU, MapReduce and CUDA) Tj T* (approaches can accelerate large workloads, but their overhead must be measured. The final design selects each data) Tj T* (structure according to its operation pattern and verifies correctness through explicit invariants and boundary tests.) Tj T* ET
